Description: Enable SpacemiT MPP hardware video decoding on K3
 Probe the independent Linlon VPU without requiring PowerVR acceleration or
 EGL/DMABUF, probe system FFmpeg hardware codecs in FFVPX audio-only builds,
 prefer system FFmpeg for RISC-V hardware decoding, and select stcodec
 CPU-visible I420 frames with normal cropping and vendor external-plane
 lifetime handling for Firefox YUV images. AV1 remains software-only on K3;
 other platforms and hardware encoding keep their GPU/DRM requirements.
Origin: vendor, SpacemiT K3 integration
Forwarded: not-needed
Author: Yeqin Su <hougelangley1987@gmail.com>
Last-Update: 2026-11-20

